{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012wZnoXFuPsMCezHtceupJx","type":"tool_result","content":"# ---------------------------------------------------------------- inner\n\ndef log_binom(n: int, k: int) -> float:\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return -math.inf\n    return math.lgamma(n + 1) - math.lgamma(k + 1) - math.lgamma(n - k + 1)\n\n\ndef logB_pair(n: int, k: int, p: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"finite_bound.py: C(n,t) C(n-t,t-1) (1-p)^(t(t-1)), t = (n-k+1)//2 (the Lean convention).\"\"\"\n    t = (n - k + 1) // 2\n    return log_binom(n, t) + log_binom(n - t, t - 1) + t * (t - 1) * math.log1p(-p)\n\n\ndef cell_task(args):\n    n, c = args\n    p = c / n\n    lc = log_connected(n, p)\n    rows = []\n    t0 = time.time()\n    for k in range(0, n):\n        N = n - k\n        t = (N + 1) // 2\n        lck = log_binom(n, k)\n        lbip = log_prob_bip(N, p, t, lc)\n        lrel = log_prob_rel(N, p, t, lc)\n        rows.append(dict(n=n, c=c, k=k, N=N, t=t, p=p,\n                         logB_pair=logB_pair(n, k, p),\n                         logB_xpair=lck + log_product_bound(N, p, t),\n                         logB_sep=lck + lbip, logB_rel=lck + lrel,\n                         log_prob_bip=lbip, log_prob_rel=lrel, log_prod=log_product_bound(N, p, t)))\n    return n, c, rows, time.time() - t0\n\n====PILOTGEN\ncheck_td.py\np17_censored.csv\np17_censored.log\np17_censored.py\np17_retry.log\np17_trial\np17_xcheck\npilot.log\npilot.py\npwtw.csv\npwtw.log\npwtw.py\nresults.csv\nto_gr.py\nreports/scratch/gnp_pilot/p17_censored.py:2:exact-track winner, built in tools/p17; see tools/README.md).  Each graph: .gr from its seed,\nreports/scratch/gnp_pilot/p17_censored.py:7:Output: p17_censored.csv with n, c, sample, seed, pw, tw_lo, tw_hi (from pwtw.csv), grtd_tw, valid, seconds, status.\nreports/scratch/gnp_pilot/p17_censored.py:15:FIELDS = [\"n\", \"c\", \"sample\", \"seed\", \"pw\", \"tw_lo\", \"tw_hi\", \"grtd_tw\", \"valid\", \"second